      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effectiveness of an association of two nitroderivatives (Stenodylate) was compared with that of its individual components. The association was found more effective in the relief of both subjective and objective symptoms in 118 cases of coronary insufficiency. In addition, it was well tolerated and would appear to be indicated in the management of this form."},
